	"data": "The XR Slider — A Volume Knob for Reality\n\nType: Room 2.0 Core System\nStatus: Conceptual — needs its own spec\nOrigin: Mirrorworlds capstone project (2022), applied to Room 2.0 sub-apps (2026)\n\nCore Idea\nA spectrum between base reality and full virtual simulation. Like a volume knob: all the way down is the real world as-is, all the way up is completely virtual, and anything in between is a blend. Every Room 2.0 sub-app exists on this spectrum and declares which positions it supports and what it…",
